              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Base bethi oSeba noSalimuna: “Sukumani, nisihlasele, ngokuba anjalo umuntu amandla akhe.” UGideyoni wasukuma, wabulala oSheba noSalimuna, wathatha imihlobiso eyayisezintanyeni zamakamela abo.",
