          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amadoda akwa-Israyeli athi kuGideyoni: “Sibuse, wena nendodana yakho, nendodana yendodana yakho, ngokuba usisindisile esandleni sakwaMidiyani;",
