          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UGideyoni wasesithi kubo: Ngizacela isicelo kini ukuthi linginike, ngulowo lalowo ecicini lempango yakhe. (Ngokuba babenamacici egolide, ngokuba babengama-Ishmayeli.)",
          "type": "text",
